# M1 Machine Learning Coursework - MNIST Addition

This repository contains the implementation of a machine learning pipeline for adding two handwritten MNIST digits. The project explores various approaches including neural networks, traditional ML algorithms, and weak classifiers.

## Project Structure
```bash

├── data/                      # Data handling and preprocessing(Place to store the dataset if you ran the code)
│   ├── MNIST/                # Raw MNIST dataset
│   ├── processed/            # Processed dataset for addition task
│   └── dataset.py           # Dataset creation and loading utilities
├── models/                   # Model implementations
│   └── Mnist_Addition_nn.py # Neural network architecture
├── training/                 # Training procedures
│   └── train.py            # Training loop implementation
├── utils/                   # Utility functions
└── requirements.txt        # Project dependencies# M1 Machine Learning Coursework - MNIST Addition
